WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.103
They have control in the House.

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:05.138
The American people need to know

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.307
that they don't have the courage

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.775
to do anything

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.744
to save the lives of children

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:12.278
who are parents need support.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.847
That when you look at that

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.615
data, you're not looking at their

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:16.683
you know, your

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:20.120
you know, kind of what it could be.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.255
But I'm listening to what I'm saying.

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:24.691
That's why the children are dying.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.926
I know I've got, you know, children

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:30.997
arming teachers that's going on.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.432
I was a teacher.

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:34.367
I was a school counselor.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.102
I was a middle school principal.

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:37.570
I was in cafeterias.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.606
Every kid allowed every day

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:40.607
in my country.

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:42.375
There's never been a shooting.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:44.310
I never get a shooting.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.445
It's time.

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:48.114
We've got guns here to protect us.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.282
And as I believe,

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:50.483
the president should have

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:51.918
somebody to protect them.

